OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fgradually dissipating this evening,
OL,7,Fwith a fine and dry night and clear
OL,8,Fspells to follow. The wind eases light
OL,9,Fin places. Feeling cooler than
OL,10,Fprevious nights in rural spots, while
OL,11,Fstaying milder in cities.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FDry with sunny spells for
OL,14,Fsome places in the morning, turning
OL,15,Fcloudier by the afternoon, with one or
OL,16,Ftwo showers possibly developing, but
OL,17,Fmost places remaining dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
