OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fand windy with possibly some rain
OL,7,Faffecting areas north of Berkshire.
OL,8,FDry with sunny spells and lighter
OL,9,Fwinds on Thursday. Mostly dry and
OL,10,Fcloudy on Friday, but remaining breezy.
